+/// Extra plies the null probe gives up when the static evaluation stands
+/// far above beta: one per two hundred centipawns, at most three.
+///
+/// The probe asks whether passing still beats beta, and the further above
+/// beta the position already stands the shallower the search that can say
+/// so. Only the probe is shortened; the verification that follows a
+/// fail-high keeps the depth it always had, since it is the check on the
+/// guess and not the guess.
+fn null_move_excess_reduction(excess: Score) -> u32 {
+    (excess / 200).clamp(0, 3) as u32
+}
